Hi all,

It seems as if we have some pretty nifty nethack godlike players our there
and it got me to thinking... how's 'bout a nethack hi score list?  This would
give all of us an idea of what the *really* good scores are like, and it 
would give us something to shoot for.

I was thinking it would work like this:
Mail me your single best high score along with all the goodies of that game.
Ie. ST DEX CON AC, exceptioal weapons, noteable achievements, etc, etc, etc.
email it to me at grogers@ravel.slac.stanford.edu.  Do not mail to the 
return of post address.

I will use your email name to identify you and develop a score format
depending on what I receive from people.  There will only be ONE occurence
of any id on the hi score list (so those of you who have 2 or more id's
will be able to cheat, I have no way to verify).

Now lets be honest here.  I have no way to validate what you say your 
score is so this will only work of you are honest.  

If I do find out that a score is invalid, or a user is posting under 2 or more
id's, s/he will be given a warning.  A second offense will result in the 
permanent removal of that user from the hi score list.  The reason for these
restrictions is to allow the maximum number of people to be on the list.

I have not determined the number of entries (20 - 50 probably).  It will
depend on the number of responses I get.

I will post the list to the newsgroup at periodic intervals.

So let's get to it.  Send me your one best score, and I'll post the list  as 
soon as I can.

